{"id":2349,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p><style>@font-face{ font-family:\"Times New Roman\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"宋体\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"Wingdings\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"Arial\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"等线\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"Calibri\";} p.MsoNormal{ mso-style-name:正文; mso-style-parent:\"\"; margin:0pt; margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:none; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; font-family:'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-font-family:宋体; font-size:10.5000pt;} h1{ mso-style-name:\"标题 1\"; mso-style-next:正文; margin:0pt; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:left; mso-outline-level:1; font-family:'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-font-family:宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight:bold; font-size:18.0000pt;} h2{ mso-style-name:\"标题 2\"; mso-style-next:正文; margin:0pt; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:left; mso-outline-level:2; font-family:'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-font-family:宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight:bold; font-size:16.0000pt;} span.10{ font-family:'Times New Roman';} span.15{ font-family:'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-font-weight:bold; font-size:16.0000pt;} span.16{ font-family:'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-font-weight:bold; font-size:18.0000pt;} p.p{ mso-style-name:\"普通\\(网站\\)\"; margin:0pt; margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:none; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; font-family:'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-font-family:宋体; font-size:12.0000pt;} span.msoIns{ mso-style-type:export-only; mso-style-name:\"\"; text-decoration:underline; text-underline:single; color:blue;} span.msoDel{ mso-style-type:export-only; mso-style-name:\"\"; text-decoration:line-through; color:red;} table.MsoNormalTable{ mso-style-name:普通表格; mso-style-parent:\"\"; mso-style-noshow:yes; mso-tstyle-rowband-size:0; mso-tstyle-colband-size:0; mso-padding-alt:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt; mso-para-margin:0pt; mso-para-margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:widow-orphan; font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:10.0000pt; mso-ansi-language:#0400; mso-fareast-language:#0400; mso-bidi-language:#0400;} @page{mso-page-border-surround-header:no; mso-page-border-surround-footer:no;}@page Section0{ size:595.2500pt 842.0000pt; vsb_temp:0.0500pt; mso-header:url(\"vsbF0A3.files/header.html\") h0; mso-footer:url(\"vsbF0A3.files/header.html\") f0;} div.Section0{page:Section0;}</style>&nbsp;为引导广大青年学子响应国家号召，投身基层、服务西部，把个人的理想追求融入新疆稳定与发展的时代洪流之中，2026年4月10日下午4时，中北大学机械工程学院于11105H顺利举办西部计划新疆专项宣讲会。本次宣讲会特邀共青团新疆维吾尔自治区委员会大学生志愿服务西部计划办公室干部、中北大学机械工程学院2020届优秀校友周丹妮主讲，学院师生代表现场参加活动。</p><div><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=DL7rs7oRTRLRvaMZzQfolQ2UzU8L4Nb4ozUanm62LzNYMm-0gihFp2hmCIa0nShfMkhVLSyDMlWkU8CPMlnkoR9ZM7Qko7lPLN7PUlUYLzQFL7M7LzQ2L8QFMmQ2nRCJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4L8Lz9sgtA8pUEcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=34187&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/EA4E165BBCF15DB8884FB8E12A1AD216/0CD16F3F/66FD6\" vheight=\"176\" vwidth=\"264\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=DL7rs7oRTRLRvaMZzQfolQ2UzU8L4Nb4ozUanm62LzNYMm-0gihFp2hmCIa0nShfMkhVLSyDMlWkU8CPMlnkoR9ZM7Qko7lPLN7PUlUYLzQFL7M7LzQ2L8QFMmQ2nRCJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4L8Lz9sgtA8pUEcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=34187&e=.png\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=DM7lsbolVkn7C8nZm9iMRGDoRr7U4GbZLl-4nRARnmTVM7C0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhkLYhkM1hRozLbLzv4LmnRU4n2nNWkU4vbL8nRMzTVozWFnlnRU4LinRMFMmQ2nRCJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4L8Lz9sgtA8pUEcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=34187&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/DB3B6C93917324CC4FFBBC793DC59E92/EDCC35D3/66FD6\" vheight=\"176\" vwidth=\"264\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=DM7lsbolVkn7C8nZm9iMRGDoRr7U4GbZLl-4nRARnmTVM7C0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhkLYhkM1hRozLbLzv4LmnRU4n2nNWkU4vbL8nRMzTVozWFnlnRU4LinRMFMmQ2nRCJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4L8Lz9sgtA8pUEcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=34187&e=.png\"></p><p>分享中，周丹妮学姐详细介绍了大学生志愿服务西部计划的背景、招募对象、服务岗位、期限及管理模式，重点解读了新疆专项在乡村教育、基层社会治理、健康乡村、卫国戍边等领域的岗位设置。她系统讲解了志愿者的生活补贴、保险保障、交通补助、休假等待遇，以及考研加分、公务员定向招录、事业编倾斜、工龄计算等优惠政策，全面解答了同学们关心的现实问题。通过鲜活的画面与事例，周丹妮学姐为同学们展现了新疆的壮美风光、多元民族风情与安全稳定的社会环境，讲述了志愿者扎根边疆、默默奉献的感人事迹，并特别点赞了山西籍志愿者在新疆克州阿图仕市哈拉峻乡谢依特小学组建戍边支教西部计划志愿者服务队的担当作为，她鼓励同学们把握机遇，将个人理想融入国家发展大局，到西部、到基层、到祖国最需要的地方去，在实践中增长才干、锤炼品格。互动环节中，同学们热情高涨，围绕报名流程、岗位选择、服务保障、生活适应等问题踊跃提问，周丹妮学姐耐心细致地一一回应，现场交流轻松而热烈。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=DUzVsRMzUDUlMfMZl-YLmrfnzfVnN7bDLRNaMzCYUmUaoRL0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hRokhkLYysMm-sL7lDnmLPU49ZnN78oRliozlsUNQkUmfFMRC8Ll7bMRWFMmQ2nRCJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4L8Lz9sgtA8pUEcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=34187&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/BC8B376270E6F31C88FA4855957BFBB0/4641A942/66FD6\" vheight=\"176\" vwidth=\"264\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=DUzVsRMzUDUlMfMZl-YLmrfnzfVnN7bDLRNaMzCYUmUaoRL0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hRokhkLYysMm-sL7lDnmLPU49ZnN78oRliozlsUNQkUmfFMRC8Ll7bMRWFMmQ2nRCJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4L8Lz9sgtA8pUEcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=34187&e=.png\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Dn7-sPo7CDL4lanZR9PU8Q7M8CYUNUbPUmnknzr2Lm7PoRN0gihFp2hmCIa0Mky4nSyYoSh2nzCZUzn2Lm78nR6RM7UYUmlbL8l8UNCYnmfFLmr7MRN8nRTFMmQ2nRCJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4L8Lz9sgtA8pUEcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=34187&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/43E29FE68A4F214D7C4D2B593E4BF2F0/25D494D9/66FD6\" vheight=\"176\" vwidth=\"264\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Dn7-sPo7CDL4lanZR9PU8Q7M8CYUNUbPUmnknzr2Lm7PoRN0gihFp2hmCIa0Mky4nSyYoSh2nzCZUzn2Lm78nR6RM7UYUmlbL8l8UNCYnmfFLmr7MRN8nRTFMmQ2nRCJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4L8Lz9sgtA8pUEcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=34187&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p>此次宣讲会，让学院学子更全面、更真切地认识西部计划新疆专项，也点燃了大家服务基层、奉献边疆的青春热情，为有意向投身西部的同学提供了权威、实用的指导。未来，机械工程学院也将持续做好西部计划宣传动员与组织工作，引导更多青年学子以青春赴使命，以奋斗践担当，在祖国边疆书写无愧于时代的青春华章!</p><p>一审一校/苏佳豪 吕晓炅</p><p>二审二校/王怡宁 王浩然</p><p>三审三校/李宗霖</p></div></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jxdl.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=DL7rs7oRTRLRvaMZzQfolQ2UzU8L4Nb4ozUanm62LzNYMm-0gihFp2hmCIa0nShfMkhVLSyDMlWkU8CPMlnkoR9ZM7Qko7lPLN7PUlUYLzQFL7M7LzQ2L8QFMmQ2nRCJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4L8Lz9sgtA8pUEcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=34187&e=.png"}